    "q-131487": {
      "dom_id": "step-q131487",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Consider the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+6{x}_{2}+2{x}_{3}=-8 \\\\ {x}_{1}-2{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+9{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3}=-12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form.",
      "worked_solution": "The augmented matrix for the system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 & 2 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 9 & 3 & -12\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 6 & 2 & -8 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 9 & 3 & -12\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 9 & 3 & -12\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 9 & 3 & -12\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131487-a",
