    "q-73916": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73916",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 4 & -12 & -20 & -24 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{5}{2} & 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce $M$ to row echelon form, and then find the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix.",
      "worked_solution": "Reducing $M$ to echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 4 & -12 & -20 & -24 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{5}{2} & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-4{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & \\frac{3}{2} & \\frac{5}{2} & 3\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & -5 & -6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y-5z=-6 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince any numbers $x,y,z$ form a solution of the final two equations $0x+0y+0z=0,$ we can remove these equations from the system. So, our system now consists of just a single equation:\n\n$$\nx-3y-5z=-6\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is $x$, and we have two free variables $y$ and $z.$ That means we need to find $x$ in terms of $y,z.$ Doing this, we get\n\n$$\nx=-6+3y+5z.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution is\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x=-6+3y+5z \\\\ y=y \\\\ z=z\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $y,z$ (the free variables) are arbitrary numbers.\n\nIn vector form, the solution can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-6+3y+5z \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}],\\,y,z\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-73916-a",
