    "q-131503": {
      "dom_id": "step-q131503",
      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "Consider the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}+3{x}_{3}=-2 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}-15{x}_{3}=10.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form.",
      "worked_solution": "The augmented matrix for the system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -5 & -15 & 10\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 5 & -5 & -15 & 10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 5 & -5 & -15 & 10\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-5){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-131503-a",
