    "q-73917": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73917",
      "name": "Question 9",
      "problem": "Consider the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{3}=2 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+6{x}_{3}=6 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-8{x}_{3}=-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix $M$ of the system to row echelon form.",
      "worked_solution": "The augmented matrix for the system is\n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 6 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 & -8\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nReducing $M$ to echelon form, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 6 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 & -8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=-{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -2 & -2 \\\\ -3 & 0 & 6 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 & -8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 & -8\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-73917-a",
