    "q-73953": {
      "dom_id": "step-q73953",
      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $M$ given by \n\n$$\nM=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 10\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFind the general solution of the linear system represented by the matrix.",
      "worked_solution": "The system corresponding to $M$ is\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}3x+5y+2z=1 \\\\ 0x-2y+4z=3 \\\\ 0x+0y+0z=10\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince there are no such numbers $x,y,z$ that form a solution of the final equation $0x+0y+0z=10,$ we can conclude that our system has no solution.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
